  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1902.07 Governing body",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1902.07 “Governing body” means the board of selectmen in a town, the board comprising the mayor and aldermen in a city, or the council in a city or town with a council, or the county commissioners in unincorporated towns and unorganized places.\n\nSource. #7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1902.07); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (formerly Env-Wq 1902.11)",
